  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 2.0 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Added support for creating, managing, and submitting for review your in-app purchases and auto-renewable subscriptions, using the resources now available in the `in-app-purchase` and `auto-renewable-subscriptions` collections. The `promoted-purchases` resources can now manage promoted in-app purchases and auto-renewable subscriptions, including their visibility and images. The resources in the `in-app-purchase-and-subscription-app-store-review-submissions` collection manage submissions for review.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/in-app-purchase",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/auto-renewable-subscriptions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/promoted-purchases",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/in-app-purchase-and-subscription-app-store-review-submissions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `customer-reviews` and `customer-review-responses` resources support retrieving customer reviews for your app that appear on the App Store, and managing your responses to the customer reviews.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/customer-reviews",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/customer-review-responses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`power-and-performance-metrics-and-logs` adds a new `HANGS` diagnostic type filter for `GET-v1-builds-_id_-diagnosticSignatures`, updates the schema for responses in `xcodeMetrics`, and adds support for long-lived tokens as described in `generating-tokens-for-api-requests`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/power-and-performance-metrics-and-logs",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-builds-_id_-diagnosticSignatures",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/xcodeMetrics",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/generating-tokens-for-api-requests"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The `GET-v1-apps-_id_-inAppPurchases` endpoint is now deprecated and replaced with the `GET-v1-apps-_id_-inAppPurchasesV2` endpoint.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-apps-_id_-inAppPurchases",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-apps-_id_-inAppPurchasesV2"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect APIs for declaring IDFA usage are now removed. In your app, APIs that offer IDFA functionality are still available but require obtaining the user’s permission using `AppTrackingTransparency`. You may also need to provide information about IDFA usage in your app’s privacy details on the App Store. For more information, see `https://developer.apple.com/app-store/user-privacy-and-data-use/` and `https://developer.apple.com/app-store/app-privacy-details/`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/AppTrackingTransparency",
            "https://developer.apple.com/app-store/user-privacy-and-data-use/",
            "https://developer.apple.com/app-store/app-privacy-details/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
